# One of the two takers of the unopened sum: `line` takes `Fit | Failed` and chooses again which variant it holds;
# its arms call only the library, so the choice holds no occurrence and the route is its own arrow.

route fits.report.line
line entry > line call
line Fit | Failed·r > line value # the route's parameter, by its name

home Fit | Failed·r line

side entry left

# a library operation whose result no name holds and which changes nothing it runs on (`r.score.toFixed(2)`) stands as
# an occurrence, in a choice frame of its own
known #125 extra choice line/?1
known #125 extra step line/?1/r.score.toFixed
known #125 extra line Fit | Failed·r > line/?1/r.score.toFixed value # toFixed is no step
